{"version":1,"content":"<p>據CNBC報道，英偉達臨時CEO科萊特·克雷斯(Colette Kress)在黃仁勳突然離職後，首次接受了採訪。她表示，公司的客户並未流失，而且市場需求正在增長。英偉達已表示，預計2028財年營收將增長75%，高於此前70%的增長預期。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586910.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.539513+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:35:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"e8127074f5ace1bf00140cbaa7b45206668eed09dcb70279b0a4f0b8f7f04e76","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}